WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.163
Verification combines several independent methods.

00:00:02.163 --> 00:00:05.878
Reverse image search can locate earlier appearances, alternate crops,

00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:08.354
and related versions of an image.

00:00:08.354 --> 00:00:14.544
An earlier publication may reveal that genuine media has been assigned a new false caption.

00:00:14.544 --> 00:00:15.370
For video,

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:20.322
keyframe analysis reviews selected frames that represent scene changes or important moments.

00:00:20.322 --> 00:00:24.862
Keyframes can be compared with image-search results, landmarks, signs, weather, clothing,

00:00:24.862 --> 00:00:29.401
or previous uploads without assuming every matching frame proves the claim.

00:00:29.401 --> 00:00:33.941
Metadata may include creation time, device, software, location, or editing history.

00:00:33.941 --> 00:00:39.306
It can be stripped, changed, or fabricated, so treat it as one source.

00:00:39.306 --> 00:00:43.433
Compare metadata with visible content, publication history, and authoritative records.

00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:47.972
Timeline checking asks whether the claimed event, upload sequence, daylight, weather,

00:00:47.972 --> 00:00:50.448
public schedule, and independent reporting align.

00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:54.163
Geolocation and chronolocation clues can support place or time,

00:00:54.163 --> 00:00:57.464
but ambiguous landmarks and reused footage require caution.

00:00:57.464 --> 00:01:01.178
Cross-source corroboration looks for independent evidence with different origins:

00:01:01.178 --> 00:01:05.305
official statements, credible reporting, other recordings, direct witnesses, public records,

00:01:05.305 --> 00:01:06.956
or known event timelines.

00:01:06.956 --> 00:01:10.670
Many accounts repeating one post are not independent confirmation.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:11.496
Preserve uncertainty.

00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:16.035
If the evidence supports only that media is unverified or miscontextualized,

00:01:16.035 --> 00:01:17.273
report that conclusion.

00:01:17.273 --> 00:01:22.638
Do not convert an incomplete check into a claim that content is synthetic.

00:01:22.638 --> 00:01:25.940
Record what further evidence would materially change confidence.
